/*
Boss teams per badge tier (see src/trainer_scaling.c). Compiled by trainerproc into
src/data/boss_tiers.h, like battle_partners.party, so they use no trainer IDs and have no
trainer flags. The boss itself (e.g. TRAINER_ROXANNE_1 in trainers.party) supplies the name,
pic, AI and battle type; a tier supplies the team, and the bag items if it lists any.
The strongest mon of a tier is written at the level cap of the tier's lowest badge count.
*/

